  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Presentation of USA-Netherlands Hydrogen Market Scan at World Hydrogen Summit 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity financed the participation of hydrogen expert Serge Ribot in the World Hydrogen Summit (WHS) 2025 in Rotterdam, to present findings from the USA-Netherlands Hydrogen Market Study.The presentation took place during the WHS session &quot;Texas as Powerhouse of the Clean Hydrogen Economy&quot;, co-organised by NBSO Texas and ICEP, highlighting opportunities for Dutch-Texan cooperation on hydrogen production, storage, and port logistics.RemarkDue to the transparency with regard to the IATI projects, a non-ODA country has been included in this project.</narrative>
  </description>
